awak was recognised as a sovereign state by the United States in 1850, and by the United Kingdom in 1864.\nFollowing recognition, Brooke expanded the Raj's territory at the expense of Brunei."}],"facts":[{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q220445","value_label":"Kuching","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Kuching"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"language","value_qid":"Q1860","value_label":"English","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P2936","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"English"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"language","value_qid":"Q33424","value_label":"Iban","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P2936","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Iban"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"language","value_qid":"Q9237","value_label":"Malay","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P2936","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Malay"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"language","value_qid":"Q7850","value_label":"Chinese","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P2936","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Chinese"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"government","value_qid":"Q164142","value_label":"protectorate","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P122","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"protectorate"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"successor","value_qid":"Q5589708","value_label":"Crown Colony of Sarawak","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P156","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Crown Colony of Sarawak"},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"flag","value_qid":null,"value_label":"Flag of Sarawak (1870–1946, 1963–1973).svg","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P41","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":null},{"qid":"Q1658411","kind":"coat","value_qid":null,"value_label":"Coat of arms of the Raj of Sarawak.svg","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P94","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":null}],"people":{},"media":{"Flag of Sarawak (1870–1946, 1963–1973).svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipe